          "title": "GEN AI ON AWS",
          "eventUrl": "https://www.meetup.com/aws-sbg-at-uvpatel-college-of-eng/events/314906294/",
          "description": "**Gen AI on AWS**\nThe AWS Students Builder Group Ganpat University is thrilled to invite you to an insightful online event focused on the future of Generative AI with AWS!\n🎙️ *Speaker:* Mr. Ashwin Raiyani Sir\n📅 *Date:* Sunday, 25th May 2026\n⏰ *Time:* 11:30 AM – 02:00 PM\n💻 *Mode:* Online\nDiscover how Generative AI is transforming industries and how AWS provides powerful tools and services to build intelligent AI-driven applications. This session will cover real-world use cases, emerging trends, and opportunities for students and developers in the AI era.\n✨ Don’t miss this opportunity to learn, explore, and interact with an industry expert!\n📢 E-certificates will be provided to all participants.",
